 that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   Dandreta  REMOVE_MRN and  sentinel lymph node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm portion of soft tan yellow adipose tissue with a 1 0cm tan pink lymph node  The lymph node is bisected and entirely submitted for frozen section as FX 1  now as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received are two containers  which are all  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  Specimen is received fresh  labeled  left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm left breast mastectomy specimen which is oriented by a suture at 12 o clock  The specimen is partially surfaced by a REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm portion of wrinkled white areolar skin which has a central 0 7cm in diameter depressed nipple which is 1cm from the nearest skin margin  The specimen is inked black posteriorly  blue anteriorly  and serially sectioned  Sectioning reveals a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm ill defined  indurated dense gray white mass which measures 2 7cm from the nearest posterior margin and 2cm from the anterior margin  The mass is located in the upper outer quadrant of the specimen  The mass is surrounded by a dense gray white fibrous tissue with focal areas of granularity and multiple cysts averaging 0 3cm in greatest dimension  The remainder of the cut surface consists of lobulated tan yellow adipose tissue with an abundant amount of interspersed dense gray white fibrous tissue and multiple cysts averaging 0 2cm in greatest dimension which are filled with a clear fluid  No discrete masses or lesions are identified  On sectioning through the mass  a metallic clip is identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the mass to surrounding tissue  with the nearest posterior margin in block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   the section containing the clip in