t necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Grace T  McKee MD Signed On  21 MAY 03 at 13 01    REVISED REMOVED_DATE        HER 2 Addendum     RESULTS OF FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION  FISH  FOR HER 2 NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION Breast  Right  block B   HER 2 neu gene in tumor cells  REMOVED_DATE  Not Amplified   See note  Note  Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER 2 to chromosome 17 signals in 60 tumor cell nuclei  A ratio of greater than REMOVED_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis  Added by  Grace T  McKee MD Signed On  27 MAY 03 at 08 45 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast excision lumpectomy  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm fibrofatty breast tissue with a short suture designating superior and a long suture designating lateral  The anterior aspect is blue inked  the posterior is black inked  the lateral is green inked  the medial is yellow inked  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm well delineated tan white gritty mass which abuts the posterior and comes to within 0 2cm of the medial  0 5cm of the anterior  0 6cm of the lateral  1 0cm of the superior  2 5cm of the inferior margins  The remaining parenchyma is predominantly yellow lobulated fatty tissue admixed with minimal thin white fibrous tissue  Representative sections are submitted sequentially from superior to inferior as follows  A  Uninvolved parenchyma toward superior margin  B D  Tumor to posterior margin  closest  to include anterior margin in D  E  Tumor to medial  second closest  to include anterior  third closest   F  Uninvolved parenchyma toward interior margin  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast final shaved margin superior half of