nchyma are submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   No lymph nodes are found within the specimen  Gross Dictation by Michael W Lawlor M D   Ph D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Michael W Lawlor M D   Ph D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by John H Eichhorn M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
