ntified  Several lymph nodes measuring from REMOVED_DATE to 2 5cm are identified within the axillary tail  The biopsy cavity  skin scar  and adjacent tissue are serially submitted from lateral to medial in A through I  a representative section of unremarkable fibrous breast parenchyma is submitted in J  the lymph nodes are submitted in K and L  Resident  EDWIN S  MONUKI  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   MODIFIED MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Unchecked.
