cision  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  03 REMOVED_MONTH 00 at 08 05 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast lumpectomy   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm fragment of fibrofatty breast tissue  with a long stitch marking lateral and a short stitch marking superior  The superior aspect is inked black  the inferior aspect blue  and the posterior aspect overinked green  The specimen is serially sectioned medial to lateral to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE firm white  ill defined mass  which grossly appears to abut the inferior deep margin  It is 1 0mm from the closest superior margin  A representative section of the inferior margin in relation to the tumor is frozen as FX 2  Adjacent to the stellate mass is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm white fibrous thickening abutting the inferior margin  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  sentinel node right axilla   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm tan pink fragment of soft tissue  which is entirely frozen as FX 1  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast final shaving   are 8 fragments of yellow pink fibroadipose tissue  which range in size from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  The unoriented fragments are inked black and serially sectioned to reveal no gross abnormalities  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right axillary contents   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 5cm unoriented piece of adipose tissue  The specimen is dissected for lymph nodes  several of which are found ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm to REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm  SECTION CODE  A   FX 2  Inferior margin and tumor  B   Tumor  lateral most section  including posterior superi