n lymph nodes ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE to 1 2cm in diameter  The lymph nodes are submitted in entirety  Section code  A  biopsy site with closest margin B E representative sections of white mass with closest margins in biopsy cavity F  medial aspect of biopsy cavity with attached skin G N axillary lymph nodes  Resident  DAVID SABLE  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Armaghan A Mostafavi  M D  PART   LEFT MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Unchecked.
